<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA ALL OUT FOR 331 V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA ALL OUT FOR 331 V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were all out for 331 in their first innings on the second day of the second and final test match against Pakistan in Colombo on Sunday.</p>
</text>
